WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.880 --> 01:31.130
[My Journey to You]

01:31.150 --> 01:34.070
[Episode 19]

01:41.680 --> 01:42.660
The elders said

01:43.340 --> 01:45.210
before we have solid evidence,

01:45.820 --> 01:47.050
we can't kill you

01:47.870 --> 01:48.670
nor

01:48.960 --> 01:51.560
can we cause permanent physical damage to you.

01:51.979 --> 01:52.950
Neither can we

01:53.780 --> 01:55.360
damage your appearance.

01:57.180 --> 01:57.930
It seems

01:58.810 --> 02:00.600
Gong Ziyu must've said a lot

02:01.710 --> 02:03.080
in front of the elders.

02:05.140 --> 02:05.880
However,

02:06.730 --> 02:09.060
to make you suffer so much you'd rather die

02:10.110 --> 02:11.710
while fulfilling

02:12.660 --> 02:13.990
the three points above,

02:15.370 --> 02:16.030
is not hard.

02:17.100 --> 02:18.360
Did you see those wine?

02:20.760 --> 02:22.890
Every cup of Yuanzhi's poisonous wine

02:24.480 --> 02:25.579
can make you

02:25.579 --> 02:28.040
regret coming to this world.

02:32.910 --> 02:34.170
What do you want to ask?

02:38.620 --> 02:40.100
Under the Sword Wielder's order,

02:40.100 --> 02:42.100
I'm here to deliver food to Miss Yun.

02:44.620 --> 02:47.280
How dare you disobey the Sword Wielder's order?

02:49.120 --> 02:49.920
Guardian Kim.

02:50.470 --> 02:51.350
Give it to me.

02:55.020 --> 02:56.220
I'll inform them now.

03:14.380 --> 03:14.980
Are you...

03:16.300 --> 03:17.720
someone from Wufeng?

03:22.590 --> 03:23.350
I am.

03:40.690 --> 03:41.170
Sir.

03:41.870 --> 03:43.070
Jin Fan is at the door.

03:43.270 --> 03:44.360
He said he's here to delivery chicken soup

03:44.360 --> 03:47.760
to Miss Yun Weishan according to the Sword Wielder's orders.

03:48.400 --> 03:49.380
Chicken soup?

03:50.860 --> 03:52.990
It's Herb Elixir chicken soup, right?

03:59.340 --> 04:00.950
Gong Ziyu really loves you.

04:02.930 --> 04:05.510
He's afraid that I would use poison to force a confession out of you

04:05.510 --> 04:07.640
that he'd rather take the risk himself

04:07.690 --> 04:09.570
and give you the Herb Elixir.

04:13.240 --> 04:14.300
Unfortunately...

04:15.680 --> 04:16.540
Confiscate it.

04:17.060 --> 04:17.459
Yes.

04:28.150 --> 04:28.950
Guardian Kim.

04:29.740 --> 04:30.640
I apologize.

04:31.260 --> 04:32.790
Young Master Gong Shangjue

04:33.270 --> 04:35.470
doesn't allow for food to be delivered.

04:37.080 --> 04:39.120
[Xue Residence]

04:39.440 --> 04:41.500
Did you go to the front hill secretly?

04:41.930 --> 04:42.540
No.

04:45.430 --> 04:46.070
Yes.

04:47.100 --> 04:48.320
I went to the front hill.

04:48.320 --> 04:49.920
According to the family ban,

04:50.020 --> 04:52.440
unless there is an emergency at the Gong family,

04:52.440 --> 04:54.570
you can never step out of the back hill.

04:55.200 --> 04:57.260
Have you forgotten the family rules?

04:59.620 --> 05:01.280
Sword Wielder was in trouble.

05:01.910 --> 05:04.230
Is that considered an emergency in the Gong family?

05:04.230 --> 05:05.290
Ridiculous.

05:06.180 --> 05:06.840
I was wrong.

05:08.790 --> 05:10.320
Was it fun at the front hill?

05:11.380 --> 05:12.050
Not really.

05:13.540 --> 05:15.650
Compared to the snowy Xue Residence,

05:16.940 --> 05:18.060
it's nothing.

05:21.780 --> 05:23.240
It's actually really fun.

05:23.280 --> 05:24.740
The front hill is very big.

05:24.770 --> 05:25.770
I almost got lost.

05:26.980 --> 05:28.000
It was fun.

05:30.100 --> 05:32.230
I wonder if Sword Wielder is in danger.

05:32.530 --> 05:34.190
The Sword Wielder is so smart,

05:34.300 --> 05:35.900
I'm sure he can turn the tide.

05:41.570 --> 05:42.240
I think...

05:43.020 --> 05:43.820
Sword Wielder

05:44.130 --> 05:46.190
is definitely in danger right now...

05:47.780 --> 05:48.990
and needs our help.

05:50.680 --> 05:52.010
Let's stop pretending.

05:52.140 --> 05:52.670
Let's go!

06:02.130 --> 06:04.660
They didn't allow me to deliver chicken soup?

06:05.410 --> 06:08.470
Gong Shangjue guessed that there was Herb Elixir in it.

06:10.580 --> 06:12.380
Zhiyuan's poison is so vicious.

06:13.190 --> 06:15.140
I wonder if Miss Yun can handle it.

06:16.070 --> 06:17.070
What do you think?

06:19.480 --> 06:21.340
There are so many strong warriors

06:21.540 --> 06:22.940
that can withstand stabs

06:23.540 --> 06:26.000
but can't take any of Gong Yuanzhi's poison.

06:29.940 --> 06:30.740
This can't do.

06:31.990 --> 06:33.720
I have to break into the prison!

06:34.340 --> 06:35.600
Break into the prison?

06:35.630 --> 06:36.890
Just with the two of us?

06:36.990 --> 06:38.650
I heard you're short of hands.

06:46.140 --> 06:46.890
Why...

06:47.820 --> 06:49.320
did you two come to the front hill?

06:49.320 --> 06:50.570
A little boy

06:50.940 --> 06:53.290
once lied to me that he would take me outside the Gong Residence

06:53.290 --> 06:54.430
to watch float parades

06:54.430 --> 06:55.630
set off sky lanterns,

06:55.730 --> 06:58.190
and watch the beautiful world of fireworks.

06:58.210 --> 06:59.210
Many years later,

06:59.400 --> 07:01.820
although that man didn't fulfil his promise,

07:01.820 --> 07:03.140
we still left the back hill

07:03.140 --> 07:04.050
because of him.

07:08.460 --> 07:08.990
Let's go.

07:09.240 --> 07:10.300
Let's make a scene.

07:13.520 --> 07:14.340
But...

07:14.960 --> 07:16.380
you have to look for Gong Zishang first.

07:16.380 --> 07:17.220
Why?

07:18.060 --> 07:19.790
Do you want to take her with you?

07:20.340 --> 07:22.450
She'll only cause trouble if you bring her along.

07:22.450 --> 07:23.710
I must take her with me.

07:24.370 --> 07:26.630
I need to borrow some gunpowder from her.

07:29.460 --> 07:30.660
You go to Shang Lineage first.

07:30.660 --> 07:32.060
I'll prepare something.

07:32.100 --> 07:33.630
I will meet you in a bit.

07:35.690 --> 07:36.210
Hey!

07:37.250 --> 07:37.740
Ha!

07:42.530 --> 07:43.530
Not bad.

07:43.890 --> 07:46.020
I think there's room for improvement.

07:49.060 --> 07:50.060
Young Master Hua.

07:50.860 --> 07:51.510
What?

07:52.330 --> 07:54.010
You're a playboy?

07:55.680 --> 07:56.940
It's Young Master Hua.

07:57.880 --> 08:01.000
The Young Master Hua of the three Hua Families of the back hill.

08:01.000 --> 08:02.200
Who are you?

08:05.950 --> 08:06.700
Xue Chongzi.

08:06.880 --> 08:08.620
What are you doing here in the front hill secretly

08:08.620 --> 08:09.740
instead of growing your Snow Lotus in the back hill?

08:09.740 --> 08:11.460
This is against the rules of the back hill.

08:11.460 --> 08:12.660
If I tell Elder Xue,

08:12.820 --> 08:13.680
you're doomed.

08:13.810 --> 08:15.610
Elder Xue is gentle and elegant.

08:15.900 --> 08:17.230
He would scold me at most

08:17.260 --> 08:19.460
and punish me to reflect on my mistakes.

08:20.300 --> 08:21.250
But Elder Hua

08:22.100 --> 08:23.230
is short-tempered,

08:23.250 --> 08:24.850
and skilled in martial arts.

08:25.560 --> 08:26.620
If he knows

08:26.760 --> 08:28.300
you have sneaked

08:28.530 --> 08:30.140
to the front hill time after time–

08:30.140 --> 08:31.300
All right, all right!

08:31.300 --> 08:32.299
Let's stop talking about it.

08:32.299 --> 08:33.360
Let's call it even.

08:33.659 --> 08:34.289
Goodbye.

08:34.640 --> 08:35.030
Hey!

08:36.460 --> 08:37.260
That won't do.

08:38.090 --> 08:39.380
We happened to be looking for Eldest Young Miss

08:39.380 --> 08:40.610
to do something big.

08:42.250 --> 08:43.320
But this big thing

08:43.340 --> 08:44.270
needs a helper.

08:44.440 --> 08:45.770
Why don't you go with us?

08:46.760 --> 08:47.430
Me?

08:48.160 --> 08:49.120
What for?

08:49.650 --> 08:50.710
Eldest Young Miss,

08:51.330 --> 08:53.500
I would like to borrow something from you.

08:53.500 --> 08:54.340
What is it?

08:55.420 --> 08:56.200
Gunpowder.

09:41.100 --> 09:41.900
It's you.

09:57.500 --> 09:58.100
All right.

09:59.290 --> 10:00.380
May I ask

10:00.820 --> 10:02.250
where are we going

10:02.400 --> 10:03.800
with so many explosives?

10:07.460 --> 10:08.990
The wall behind the prison.

10:11.180 --> 10:12.380
What are we going for?

10:13.970 --> 10:15.570
I bribed one of the guards

10:16.100 --> 10:18.290
and asked about the location of Yun Weishan's prison.

10:18.290 --> 10:19.530
We blow up the outer wall

10:19.530 --> 10:20.390
and rescue her.

10:22.060 --> 10:23.100
-See you.
-See you.

10:23.100 --> 10:23.540
Hey.

10:28.260 --> 10:30.920
Do you know how many rules this is going to break?

10:31.030 --> 10:32.940
My father will beat me up so bad my head swells up like a pig's.

10:32.940 --> 10:34.780
Have you seen that big pig head

10:34.780 --> 10:35.850
on the dining table during new years'?

10:35.850 --> 10:38.050
I really can't. I'm going back to sleep.

10:39.860 --> 10:40.390
Zishang!

10:47.590 --> 10:48.280
I need you.

10:53.410 --> 10:54.450
I, Gong Zishang,

10:54.710 --> 10:56.390
am not afraid of death.

10:57.370 --> 10:59.500
For the sake of my sister, Yun Weishan,

10:59.570 --> 11:00.100
let's go.

11:10.890 --> 11:11.880
Let's go!

11:14.900 --> 11:15.500
It's here.

11:16.160 --> 11:17.210
Oh, sorry.

11:18.110 --> 11:18.960
Sorry for wasting time.

11:18.960 --> 11:19.500
Where?

11:19.500 --> 11:20.020
Behind.

11:20.740 --> 11:21.460
Hurry!

11:51.780 --> 11:52.310
Brother.

11:52.800 --> 11:54.200
Did Yun Weishan confess?

12:02.200 --> 12:03.740
Are you in some trouble?

12:04.650 --> 12:05.710
Do you need me to go–

12:10.550 --> 12:12.410
Don't follow me. It's dangerous.

12:47.940 --> 12:49.210
[New Moon]

13:11.620 --> 13:13.480
Take Yun Weishan and leave first.

14:22.060 --> 14:22.860
Yuanzhi!

14:24.380 --> 14:25.600
Why are you covered in blood?

14:25.600 --> 14:26.470
It's not my blood.

14:26.470 --> 14:27.200
It's my brother's.

14:27.200 --> 14:27.660
Hurry!

14:31.020 --> 14:31.550
Brother!

14:33.290 --> 14:34.620
Go get some guards over!

14:36.960 --> 14:37.710
Go!

14:59.460 --> 15:00.540
Do you need help?

15:01.590 --> 15:02.020
No.

15:05.140 --> 15:06.080
In my eyes,

15:06.290 --> 15:07.530
you are my brother.

15:08.010 --> 15:09.100
I'm not shy about it.

15:09.100 --> 15:10.360
What are you afraid of?

15:34.690 --> 15:35.540
Didn't you say

15:35.930 --> 15:37.180
you were worried

15:37.410 --> 15:39.470
and couldn't sleep yesterday night?

15:40.060 --> 15:41.100
Go back and rest.

15:42.300 --> 15:44.830
Young Master Shangjue is seriously injured.

15:44.920 --> 15:46.250
How could I fall asleep?

15:48.340 --> 15:49.380
How fake.

15:50.930 --> 15:52.730
I knew who you are a long time ago.

15:58.020 --> 15:59.480
A Gushan Sect descendent.

16:00.170 --> 16:03.170
You married into the Gong family just for protection.

16:04.130 --> 16:05.930
You don't love my brother at all.

16:08.740 --> 16:11.800
So Young Master Shangjue has already told you about it.

16:11.900 --> 16:12.660
It seems

16:13.310 --> 16:14.510
he really trusts you.

16:16.600 --> 16:17.200
Of course.

16:17.950 --> 16:19.550
You and Gong Ziyu

16:19.960 --> 16:21.030
are brothers.

16:22.380 --> 16:23.900
Why are you

16:24.750 --> 16:26.550
so ruthless towards each other?

16:26.750 --> 16:28.550
In order to protect Yun Weishan,

16:29.350 --> 16:31.350
Gong Ziyu rather injure his family.

16:44.220 --> 16:44.950
Brother!

16:56.190 --> 16:57.460
Shangjue has been worried that

16:57.460 --> 16:59.420
there will be internal fights within the Gong family,

16:59.420 --> 17:01.680
allowing Wufeng to take advantage of it.

17:02.380 --> 17:03.620
If this causes

17:03.620 --> 17:05.480
the Gong family to be fragmented,

17:06.420 --> 17:07.940
Gong Ziyu will be the thousand-year sinner

17:07.940 --> 17:09.040
to the Gong family.

17:11.569 --> 17:14.099
From what I know about Young Master Shangjue,

17:14.530 --> 17:17.190
even if he were besieged by Gong Ziyu and Jin Fan,

17:18.230 --> 17:20.430
he wouldn't have been so badly injured.

17:20.859 --> 17:24.390
That's if nothing went wrong with my brother's internal skill.

17:26.290 --> 17:27.300
What happened?

17:32.340 --> 17:34.070
The medicine has been applied.

17:34.140 --> 17:35.070
I'll guard here.

17:35.550 --> 17:36.690
Go back and rest.

17:40.100 --> 17:41.330
Thank you, Yuanzhi.

17:54.730 --> 17:56.490
Make some porridge for Young Master Shangjue.

17:56.490 --> 17:58.510
Add some ginseng in it to help replenish his chi.

17:58.510 --> 18:00.310
Remember to grind the porridge.

18:01.020 --> 18:01.490
Yes.

18:02.610 --> 18:03.210
By the way,

18:04.340 --> 18:05.740
there are guards all over

18:05.740 --> 18:06.800
the Jue Residence.

18:07.060 --> 18:08.590
Why are they missing today?

18:08.900 --> 18:10.380
At regular time intervals,

18:10.380 --> 18:12.980
Young Master Yuanzhi will dismiss all the servants

18:12.980 --> 18:16.290
and only allow himself to be by Young Master Shangjue's side,

18:16.290 --> 18:20.150
saying that Young Master Shangjue needs to cultivate his inner skill

18:20.250 --> 18:21.580
and can't be disturbed.

18:27.360 --> 18:27.840
Oh.

18:29.290 --> 18:30.080
How long

18:30.250 --> 18:31.510
is this time interval?

18:31.630 --> 18:32.630
Around...

18:32.700 --> 18:33.430
half a month.

18:35.660 --> 18:36.310
I see.

18:47.970 --> 18:48.950
What if

18:49.680 --> 18:51.150
our mission is the same?

18:53.720 --> 18:54.980
July heat,

18:56.630 --> 18:57.690
countless merits.

19:00.590 --> 19:01.790
What if I tell you

19:02.540 --> 19:03.510
I can give you

19:03.740 --> 19:04.610
what you want?

19:05.620 --> 19:06.350
How's that?

19:09.050 --> 19:10.700
It depends on

19:11.100 --> 19:12.300
what you want from me.

19:16.020 --> 19:17.380
Kill Gong Shangjue.

19:22.690 --> 19:24.330
You must be joking.

19:24.700 --> 19:27.290
Both Gong Shangjue and the dead Gong Huanyu

19:27.860 --> 19:29.940
are both Sword Wielder successors who

19:29.940 --> 19:31.870
have both passed the three trials.

19:32.260 --> 19:33.540
In the whole Gong family,

19:33.540 --> 19:36.470
they are the two most highly skilled in martial arts.

19:36.580 --> 19:38.230
In terms of strength,

19:38.500 --> 19:40.160
the highest level Lang

19:40.760 --> 19:42.690
may not even be able to handle them.

19:43.100 --> 19:44.560
Do you expect me to do that?

19:44.820 --> 19:46.250
What if I tell you

19:46.900 --> 19:47.970
every half a month,

19:48.310 --> 19:50.950
his internal skill will decrease significantly

19:50.950 --> 19:52.500
and has at least four hours

19:52.740 --> 19:54.740
with completely no internal skill?

20:19.760 --> 20:21.670
It should be easy

20:22.520 --> 20:25.320
to kill someone without any internal skill at all.

20:26.600 --> 20:27.460
Which day is it?

20:32.580 --> 20:33.790
What you want

20:34.200 --> 20:35.660
is hidden in the back hill.

20:36.650 --> 20:38.450
I'll tell you the exact location

20:39.170 --> 20:41.570
when you have really killed Gong Shangjue.

20:42.780 --> 20:43.950
How can I trust you?

20:46.230 --> 20:47.470
You can gamble.

21:19.340 --> 21:21.070
When you enter the Gong family,

21:23.050 --> 21:26.110
will you fall in love with someone from the Gong family?

21:26.720 --> 21:27.880
Impossible.

21:58.520 --> 21:59.930
The Three Forms of the Moon Slash

21:59.930 --> 22:00.860
are the New Moon,

22:00.930 --> 22:01.930
Little Full Moon,

22:02.030 --> 22:03.290
and the Crescent Moon.

22:06.340 --> 22:07.060
New Moon.

22:06.380 --> 22:10.620
[New Moon]

22:07.520 --> 22:08.820
Attack the enemy immediately after brandishing the sword

22:08.820 --> 22:10.050
with the sword energy invisible.

22:10.050 --> 22:11.030
It's of no trace

22:11.290 --> 22:12.660
and is an all attack and no defence move.

22:12.660 --> 22:14.460
The sword goes against the edge,

22:17.570 --> 22:19.020
and the cloud goes on for miles,

22:19.020 --> 22:20.770
the full moon comes up from the east,

22:20.770 --> 22:24.090
[Little Full Moon]

22:21.400 --> 22:22.860
with the wind not stopping.

22:22.860 --> 22:24.660
and leaving absolutely no flaw.

22:25.410 --> 22:27.260
The Little Full Moon is a sparring move.

22:27.260 --> 22:28.520
It goes for a long time.

22:28.860 --> 22:30.060
One hook and one push,

22:30.090 --> 22:32.740
with the shadow and the sword's edge becoming one,

22:32.740 --> 22:34.200
make the movements silent

22:34.740 --> 22:35.660
and flawless.

22:47.610 --> 22:48.930
The Crescent Moon kills cruelly.

22:48.930 --> 22:50.390
The fire burns it to ashes,

22:50.420 --> 22:52.020
and the path not left behind.

22:52.060 --> 22:53.230
The heart beats with the mind,

22:53.230 --> 22:54.360
combining into one.

22:57.470 --> 22:58.400
The last move.

22:57.570 --> 23:00.690
[Crescent Moon]

22:58.900 --> 22:59.960
The Crescent Moon.

23:09.530 --> 23:10.760
Everything is ready.

23:11.050 --> 23:11.930
Let's set off.

23:14.240 --> 23:15.010
What is this?

23:16.800 --> 23:18.200
The moonlight is stable.

23:20.350 --> 23:21.900
The moon shocks the ocean.

23:23.320 --> 23:25.250
The aftermoon returns to its full,

23:25.750 --> 23:27.280
killing the moon immortal.

23:28.910 --> 23:30.570
This is what my father left me.

23:31.050 --> 23:33.650
The Three Forms of Moon Slash sword technique.

23:34.090 --> 23:36.150
I fought too hard with Gong Shangjue.

23:36.920 --> 23:38.450
The sword is a little tired.

23:39.550 --> 23:41.780
I suddenly remembered that there is

23:42.220 --> 23:43.970
a top grade sharpening stone in my father's study.

23:43.970 --> 23:45.230
So I came to look for it,

23:47.100 --> 23:48.410
but found this silk bag

23:50.100 --> 23:51.700
under the sharpening stone.

23:53.620 --> 23:54.760
It seems that

23:56.390 --> 23:58.720
he has been protecting you all this while.

24:12.770 --> 24:13.370
Ziyu.

24:14.020 --> 24:14.620
Lady Wuji.

24:16.940 --> 24:18.570
I just came back from the ancestral hall.

24:18.570 --> 24:19.530
I heard that you

24:19.560 --> 24:22.210
blew up the prison in the middle of the night to save Yun Weishan.

24:22.210 --> 24:23.830
The Gong family is in chaos.

24:25.030 --> 24:25.480
Ziyu.

24:26.430 --> 24:27.270
Is it worth it

24:27.720 --> 24:28.650
for Yun Weishan?

24:33.990 --> 24:34.620
Lady Wuji.

24:36.000 --> 24:37.400
I don't want to lie to you.

24:38.100 --> 24:38.880
But now,

24:39.210 --> 24:40.870
I can't tell you the truth yet.

24:42.530 --> 24:43.350
Later,

24:43.620 --> 24:45.080
I'll tell you everything.

24:45.200 --> 24:45.760
Okay?

24:51.930 --> 24:52.830
You've grown up

24:54.380 --> 24:55.710
and have your own ideas.

24:57.400 --> 24:59.130
Since you don't want to tell me,

24:59.140 --> 25:00.540
I won't force you.

25:03.900 --> 25:05.760
You resemble your father so much.

25:14.140 --> 25:14.750
Mei.

25:19.360 --> 25:20.010
Really?

25:22.580 --> 25:24.640
When you come back from the back hill,

25:25.610 --> 25:27.410
I have something to tell you too.

25:27.890 --> 25:30.690
Is that something you can't say at this moment too?

25:31.820 --> 25:32.190
Yes.

25:35.260 --> 25:35.860
All right.

25:36.940 --> 25:37.890
When I return,

25:38.410 --> 25:40.140
I will find a time to talk to you.

25:41.260 --> 25:42.590
Like when you were a kid?

25:43.820 --> 25:44.950
Eating candied haws

25:46.140 --> 25:47.600
and talking to me on and on.

25:49.300 --> 25:50.090
To be honest,

25:50.540 --> 25:51.200
it's been a long time

25:51.200 --> 25:53.200
since I've eaten your candied haws.

25:53.930 --> 25:54.890
Do you want it?

25:56.480 --> 25:58.080
I'll have it prepared for you

25:58.420 --> 26:00.030
and you can eat it when you come back.

26:00.030 --> 26:00.410
Okay.

26:01.850 --> 26:03.150
You really dote on me.

26:10.550 --> 26:11.280
I'm leaving.

26:11.970 --> 26:12.420
Okay.

26:15.860 --> 26:16.460
Take care.

26:16.940 --> 26:17.640
You too.

26:48.220 --> 26:49.990
Why did you make such a big fuss?

26:50.140 --> 26:51.410
You went too far.

26:51.580 --> 26:52.500
We were there to save people,

26:52.500 --> 26:54.170
not to kill Gong Shangjue.

26:54.340 --> 26:55.540
What should we do now?

26:55.580 --> 26:56.710
Let go of my face first.

26:56.710 --> 26:58.140
No way.

27:00.610 --> 27:02.270
We didn't hit too hard either.

27:02.340 --> 27:03.440
But we didn’t expect that when

27:03.440 --> 27:05.810
three of them to each use a form of the Three Forms of Snow Saber,

27:05.810 --> 27:07.470
it'd be so powerful combined.

27:07.900 --> 27:09.910
We went overboard cause we were too hasty.

27:09.910 --> 27:13.570
Besides, Gong Yuanzhi's hidden weapons are indeed hard to deal with.

27:13.570 --> 27:14.570
Where is Miss Yun?

27:15.250 --> 27:17.050
She's been sent back to her room.

27:18.820 --> 27:19.780
Where is Gong Ziyu?

27:19.780 --> 27:21.060
He was just behind me.

27:21.080 --> 27:21.760
He's gone.

27:22.920 --> 27:25.450
Did he pass out in the yard after getting hurt?

27:25.720 --> 27:27.820
Sword Wielder went straight to the back hill.

27:27.820 --> 27:28.420
Again?

27:28.440 --> 27:29.070
Again?

27:29.100 --> 27:30.710
Do you think just because you are a bystander

27:30.710 --> 27:33.110
you can just rub salt into my wound?

27:36.430 --> 27:37.230
According...

27:42.570 --> 27:44.570
According to the Gong family rules,

27:44.660 --> 27:45.910
no one is allowed to disturb

27:45.910 --> 27:48.710
or stop those who are participating in the trials.

27:48.940 --> 27:49.460
So,

27:49.530 --> 27:51.390
even if they want to punish the Sword Wielder,

27:51.390 --> 27:53.210
they have to wait until the trial is over.

27:53.210 --> 27:55.220
Once Sword Wielder passes the trial,

27:55.220 --> 27:57.240
Gong Ziyu will be the legitimate Sword Wielder.

27:57.240 --> 27:58.290
It'll be hard

27:58.430 --> 27:59.490
to punish him then.

28:02.660 --> 28:03.910
Let’s go to the Elder’s Hall

28:03.910 --> 28:05.230
to buy some time now.

28:05.360 --> 28:06.280
Young Master Hua,

28:06.280 --> 28:07.410
go find your father.

28:18.420 --> 28:19.500
Why are you here?

28:31.640 --> 28:32.840
How inappropriate of you

28:32.840 --> 28:34.170
to be dressed like this?

28:34.460 --> 28:35.620
You disappoint me.

28:36.680 --> 28:38.360
You have no talent.

28:38.390 --> 28:40.010
And you have to waste your time

28:40.010 --> 28:42.270
hanging out with Gong Zishang every day.

28:42.780 --> 28:44.660
I turned a blind eye

28:44.680 --> 28:45.680
and indulged you.

28:46.540 --> 28:47.450
How dare you...

28:48.920 --> 28:50.520
Are you trying to piss me off?

28:51.720 --> 28:52.270
Father!

28:53.060 --> 28:54.190
After so many years,

28:54.560 --> 28:55.800
the Hua family has never developed

28:55.800 --> 28:57.130
more powerful weapons.

28:57.290 --> 28:59.380
Wufeng is getting stronger day by day.

28:59.380 --> 29:00.660
I just want to develop stronger weapons

29:00.660 --> 29:01.680
with Gong Zishang

29:01.710 --> 29:02.570
to protect the Gong family.

29:02.570 --> 29:03.370
Shut up!

29:05.000 --> 29:06.350
You overestimate yourself.

29:06.350 --> 29:07.810
You don’t know your place.

29:10.070 --> 29:10.870
The Hua family

29:11.300 --> 29:12.960
is humiliated because of you.

29:15.820 --> 29:16.410
Father!

29:17.380 --> 29:17.980
Father!

29:30.090 --> 29:32.140
[Jue]

29:32.350 --> 29:33.070
Young Master.

29:33.070 --> 29:34.210
Young Master Yuanzhi.

29:34.210 --> 29:35.940
Gong Ziyu went to the back hill.

29:36.020 --> 29:38.140
He's going to do the trial at this time?

29:38.140 --> 29:38.950
Yuanzhi?

29:40.860 --> 29:41.390
Brother.

29:41.890 --> 29:43.560
Once Gong Ziyu enters the back hill,

29:43.560 --> 29:45.090
we can do nothing about him.

29:45.430 --> 29:46.560
I'll go stop him now.

29:46.640 --> 29:47.240
Don't go.

29:49.140 --> 29:50.180
He has learned

29:50.200 --> 29:53.220
the Three Forms of Snow Saber and the Three Forms of Moon Slash.

29:53.220 --> 29:54.420
You can’t defeat him.

29:55.050 --> 29:56.250
I may not be able to win

29:56.580 --> 29:57.550
a proper fight.

29:58.780 --> 29:59.840
But I don't believe

30:00.800 --> 30:02.460
he can dodge by hidden weapon.

30:03.410 --> 30:04.470
Didn't you see

30:05.750 --> 30:07.890
who broke into the prison with him?

30:09.560 --> 30:10.830
Young Master Xue,

30:11.350 --> 30:12.370
Xue Chongzi,

30:13.530 --> 30:14.710
Young Master Hua,

30:15.650 --> 30:16.690
and

30:17.680 --> 30:21.010
Young Master Yue who helped Yun Weishan cover her identity.

30:21.540 --> 30:23.350
Although I don't know

30:23.570 --> 30:25.370
how Gong ZIyu bribed them,

30:26.450 --> 30:27.310
now,

30:28.770 --> 30:31.100
he has the whole back hill supporting him.

30:33.860 --> 30:35.850
Though the elders lean towards me,

30:37.060 --> 30:41.460
they definitely don't want to see an internal conflict within the Gong family.

30:41.960 --> 30:43.980
We can't confront Gong Ziyu.

30:45.900 --> 30:46.900
What should we do?

30:47.890 --> 30:49.530
Should we just let him

30:49.560 --> 30:51.380
become the Sword Wielder like this?

30:51.380 --> 30:51.970
No.

30:53.200 --> 30:54.800
The existence of Yun Weishan

30:56.020 --> 30:58.290
is Gong Ziyu's biggest weakness.

30:59.370 --> 31:00.130
So,

31:00.690 --> 31:03.350
you have to work with Shangguan Qian

31:03.940 --> 31:05.800
and execute according to my plan.

31:06.930 --> 31:08.240
Shangguan Qian?

31:09.410 --> 31:10.540
Is she trustworthy?

31:12.180 --> 31:12.710
Brother.

31:13.490 --> 31:15.200
Just tell me your plan.

31:15.670 --> 31:16.730
I will do it for you.

31:20.260 --> 31:21.610
There are some things

31:24.010 --> 31:25.680
that only she can do.

31:33.360 --> 31:34.310
I'll do anything

31:34.850 --> 31:35.710
for you.

32:13.550 --> 32:14.150
Elder Hua.

32:15.840 --> 32:16.760
You are smart.

32:18.070 --> 32:20.600
You knew to come to the back hill immediately.

32:20.860 --> 32:21.990
I need to remind you,

32:22.610 --> 32:23.540
this third trial

32:24.300 --> 32:26.360
is not as easy as the first two trials.

32:26.420 --> 32:28.550
Many outstanding Gong family talents

32:29.050 --> 32:30.510
failed on the third trial.

32:34.740 --> 32:36.940
The closer one is to success, the more difficult it is.

32:36.940 --> 32:38.340
Rest assured, Elder Hua.

32:38.460 --> 32:39.940
I won’t take it lightly.

32:43.420 --> 32:44.580
My son will relay

32:45.450 --> 32:47.510
the content of the third trial to you.

32:48.290 --> 32:49.150
Sword Wielder,

32:49.670 --> 32:51.130
I will take my leave first.

33:01.820 --> 33:03.890
Young Master Hua is really high and mighty,

33:03.890 --> 33:04.960
and handsome.

33:08.280 --> 33:09.180
But

33:09.620 --> 33:11.360
you look totally different

33:11.950 --> 33:13.230
from the servant I remember.

33:13.230 --> 33:14.430
Keep your voice down.

33:14.430 --> 33:15.890
My father hasn't gone far.

33:16.860 --> 33:18.130
Are you so afraid of your father?

33:18.130 --> 33:18.730
Of course.

33:18.940 --> 33:20.800
Aren't you afraid of your father?

33:28.020 --> 33:29.750
This sword is quite beautiful.

33:30.020 --> 33:31.270
You have good taste.

33:31.880 --> 33:33.340
This is my favorite sword.

33:33.620 --> 33:34.760
The Hua famly

33:34.930 --> 33:36.590
calls it Cloud Weaved Feather.

33:36.590 --> 33:38.460
Because it's too light and too thin,

33:38.460 --> 33:39.520
just like feathers

33:39.580 --> 33:40.720
weaved with clouds.

33:43.660 --> 33:44.950
Cloud Weaved Feather.

33:47.180 --> 33:48.520
Can I have this sword

33:48.680 --> 33:50.540
after I become the Sword Wielder?

33:50.950 --> 33:52.820
If you pass the Trials of the Three Realms,

33:52.820 --> 33:53.800
every sword here

33:54.110 --> 33:55.240
would belong to you.

33:56.420 --> 33:56.880
No need.

34:01.510 --> 34:02.640
I only want this one.

34:27.340 --> 34:27.989
Elder Yue?

34:31.050 --> 34:32.780
You were poisoned by the smoke.

34:32.969 --> 34:33.969
You're awake now.

34:41.090 --> 34:43.090
The Sword Wielder blew up the prison

34:43.090 --> 34:43.980
to save you.

34:45.340 --> 34:46.530
In order to save you,

34:47.040 --> 34:49.500
he's already against the whole Gong family.

34:52.330 --> 34:54.790
So you can't stay at the Gong family anymore.

34:55.400 --> 34:56.370
You must leave.

35:00.040 --> 35:00.650
I know.

35:04.420 --> 35:05.680
I'm a Wufeng assassin.

35:08.400 --> 35:10.200
Although I didn't want to be one,

35:12.020 --> 35:13.820
my hands are still full of blood,

35:14.780 --> 35:16.710
and I've killed countless people.

35:17.110 --> 35:20.510
The Gong family won't allow me to be the Sword Wielder's wife.

35:24.890 --> 35:25.620
Don't worry.

35:27.520 --> 35:28.680
I will leave.

35:33.620 --> 35:34.520
For yourself,

35:35.140 --> 35:36.340
you have to leave too.

35:42.180 --> 35:43.310
You resemble Yun Qe.

35:44.860 --> 35:45.660
Back then,

35:46.290 --> 35:47.470
I was selfish

35:49.140 --> 35:50.990
and kept her on my own accord.

35:55.050 --> 35:56.730
But it ended up killing her.

36:02.410 --> 36:06.010
I don't want the Sword Wielder to go through the same pain as I did.

36:10.740 --> 36:12.980
Every time the blade falls,

36:12.980 --> 36:13.940
I think

36:16.220 --> 36:17.310
life

36:19.780 --> 36:21.170
is just a breath.

36:23.300 --> 36:25.030
In the moment of life and death,

36:26.800 --> 36:28.260
pain is nothing but brief.

36:28.860 --> 36:30.260
What's so scary about it?

36:33.070 --> 36:34.830
But after Yun Que died,

36:37.930 --> 36:38.970
I realized

36:41.830 --> 36:42.920
it's not like that.

36:48.210 --> 36:49.870
What life and death seperates

36:52.600 --> 36:55.260
is the time where mountain flowers bloom vastly

36:56.000 --> 36:58.660
but having no one to look at each other by my side.

37:04.080 --> 37:06.410
It will be a rainy night with birds crying,

37:08.030 --> 37:09.830
but no one to comfort my sadness.

37:14.540 --> 37:17.740
It's the joy of being together with all three generations

37:18.570 --> 37:20.140
to grow old together,

37:24.320 --> 37:24.970
but I

37:27.620 --> 37:31.420
cut off all the relationships and love in the world with my own hands.

37:31.930 --> 37:32.580
Do you...

37:34.000 --> 37:35.030
like me?

37:38.590 --> 37:39.410
No I don't.

37:43.680 --> 37:45.150
I can't atone

37:48.420 --> 37:50.270
for the sins I carry.

37:52.700 --> 37:53.920
But you are free now.

37:57.500 --> 37:59.360
The Fortnight Flies are fake too.

38:00.260 --> 38:01.580
You can leave Wufeng,

38:03.280 --> 38:04.730
find a quiet place,

38:06.260 --> 38:07.590
find a reliable person

38:09.410 --> 38:11.670
and spend the rest of your life together.

38:12.580 --> 38:15.180
I promised Wufeng to come to the Gong family...

38:17.130 --> 38:18.770
to get freedom.

38:21.740 --> 38:23.740
I don't want to hurt people anymore.

38:27.590 --> 38:29.440
I can find a quiet place.

38:32.720 --> 38:34.400
But I won't look for anyone

38:38.470 --> 38:40.270
to spend the rest of my life with.

38:41.300 --> 38:42.510
I already found them.

38:49.850 --> 38:50.840
Before that,

38:51.670 --> 38:53.530
don't let the Sword Wielder know.

38:55.200 --> 38:55.890
Otherwise,

38:57.610 --> 38:58.910
he won't let you go.

39:00.960 --> 39:01.710
Don't worry.

39:07.980 --> 39:09.140
But before that,

39:11.390 --> 39:13.250
I want to spend more time with him.

39:15.730 --> 39:16.950
For the last days,

39:20.820 --> 39:22.350
I want to keep some memories

39:25.490 --> 39:26.550
so that it can...

39:29.310 --> 39:31.510
help me continue living my future days.

39:40.220 --> 39:41.740
Do you see the knives in front?

39:41.740 --> 39:43.270
The trial of the third realm

39:43.530 --> 39:44.870
is to forge a new sword

39:45.090 --> 39:46.950
with the Thousand-Year Xuan Iron.

39:46.950 --> 39:49.220
Then I will choose one of these six swords

39:49.430 --> 39:50.590
to fight with you.

39:51.290 --> 39:52.900
If the sword you have forged

39:52.990 --> 39:53.800
can break it,

39:54.260 --> 39:56.590
the trial will be considered successful.

39:58.260 --> 39:59.310
Six swords?

40:00.300 --> 40:01.760
Then do I have to break

40:01.940 --> 40:02.920
all six swords

40:03.460 --> 40:04.400
or...

40:04.570 --> 40:06.300
I just need to break one of them?

40:06.580 --> 40:07.370
Six?

40:08.500 --> 40:10.500
Don't underestimate these swords.

40:10.580 --> 40:12.980
It depends on who's wielding the sword too.

40:13.220 --> 40:14.880
I know what you're capable of.

40:15.430 --> 40:16.210
I think

40:16.210 --> 40:17.210
you can't beat me.

40:17.590 --> 40:18.650
As the saying goes,

40:19.240 --> 40:20.460
a hero with his bare hands

40:20.460 --> 40:23.240
is no match to a hot-headed man with strong weapons.

40:23.240 --> 40:24.500
I'll tell you secretly later

40:24.500 --> 40:26.030
the weakness of each sword.

40:26.340 --> 40:28.870
Know yourself and your enemy, and never lose a match.

40:28.870 --> 40:30.020
Then pick one

40:30.050 --> 40:31.380
you think you can break.

40:32.490 --> 40:35.150
The previous trial takers picked without knowing anything.

40:35.150 --> 40:36.780
I'm helping you on the sake

40:36.810 --> 40:37.740
of Gong Zishang.

40:38.020 --> 40:39.280
Aren't I a good friend?

40:39.870 --> 40:42.330
What you said can only deceive Gong Zishang.

40:43.200 --> 40:44.170
You're just afraid

40:44.170 --> 40:45.420
that I can't pass the trial

40:45.420 --> 40:46.780
and when the elders question me,

40:46.780 --> 40:47.780
you can’t escape.

40:48.320 --> 40:49.130
My goodness.

40:49.390 --> 40:50.970
You have to pass.

41:37.650 --> 41:39.510
The flowers haven't bloomed yet.

41:39.790 --> 41:41.250
Why did you pluck them off?

41:42.350 --> 41:44.950
Because only the flowers that haven't bloomed

41:45.020 --> 41:46.620
will be remembered forever.

41:50.900 --> 41:52.700
He likes white flowers the most.

41:58.260 --> 41:59.930
I remember you said

42:00.520 --> 42:01.920
he doesn't like flowers.

42:02.940 --> 42:03.740
Why

42:03.950 --> 42:05.480
does he like white flowers?

42:06.020 --> 42:07.620
Shangjue doesn't like them.

42:09.100 --> 42:11.030
The person who likes white flowers

42:11.890 --> 42:12.810
is Lang.

42:16.270 --> 42:17.470
In Shangjue's heart,

42:20.300 --> 42:21.330
we who are alive,

42:22.390 --> 42:24.960
can never compare to the dead Lang.

42:25.470 --> 42:26.890
How did Lang die?

42:27.630 --> 42:28.440
Lang

42:30.860 --> 42:32.310
died ten years ago

42:33.860 --> 42:36.390
in that winter which changed the Gong family.

43:03.830 --> 43:04.430
Father.

43:04.810 --> 43:06.070
Are you looking for me?

43:09.710 --> 43:11.640
You're always in the Yu Residence.

43:12.600 --> 43:14.510
Where is your home exactly?

43:18.780 --> 43:19.980
People say

43:20.900 --> 43:23.710
the Shang Lineage is the Yu Lineage's lackey.

43:25.400 --> 43:26.730
You're admitting to it?

43:29.830 --> 43:31.030
If you have this time,

43:32.210 --> 43:35.070
you might as well take care of your younger brother.

43:35.820 --> 43:36.950
Father, I was wrong.

43:44.810 --> 43:45.940
You're wrong?

43:47.120 --> 43:48.050
Unfortunately,

43:49.580 --> 43:51.200
I'm useless now.

43:52.520 --> 43:54.000
I can't do anything.

43:55.080 --> 43:55.950
No, Father.

43:56.880 --> 43:57.880
You still have me.

43:58.420 --> 44:00.150
You can tell me anything.

44:00.180 --> 44:01.060
As a woman,

44:03.580 --> 44:04.510
what can you do?

44:10.090 --> 44:11.090
The Shang Lineage

44:12.140 --> 44:14.340
can only wait for your brother to grow up

44:14.760 --> 44:16.420
before it can be revitalized.

44:21.240 --> 44:22.110
Ten years ago,

44:23.210 --> 44:26.180
the Cangdong Thunder Sect that formed an alliance with the Gong family,

44:26.180 --> 44:27.980
in order to avoid Wufeng's hunt,

44:28.700 --> 44:30.800
sought protection from the Gong family.

44:30.800 --> 44:32.450
The Gong family has made an exception

44:32.450 --> 44:34.780
to let the whole family of the Thunder Sect

44:35.040 --> 44:36.240
into the Gong family.

44:37.570 --> 44:40.830
But who would have thought that this was all Wufeng's trap?

44:40.990 --> 44:43.720
They were all impersonated by Wufeng's masters.

44:46.300 --> 44:47.490
During that attack,

44:48.320 --> 44:50.520
the price the Gong family paid was high.

44:51.610 --> 44:53.370
Those in my father's generation,

44:53.370 --> 44:56.770
except Gong Hongyu and Gong Liushang who managed to survive,

44:57.910 --> 44:59.240
the other Lineage Heads

44:59.540 --> 45:00.720
and adult men

45:01.070 --> 45:02.530
mostly died in the battle.

45:04.220 --> 45:06.750
It was the biggest lineage in the Gong Family.

45:08.500 --> 45:09.300
Now,

45:10.550 --> 45:13.550
it has become a joke in the eyes of everyone.

45:24.830 --> 45:26.760
What about the women and children?

45:30.580 --> 45:32.680
They hid in the secret tunnel of the back hill.

45:32.680 --> 45:34.140
Then why did Lang...

47:07.380 --> 47:07.840
Mother.

47:10.590 --> 47:11.230
Mother.

47:16.440 --> 47:17.220
Brother...

47:24.900 --> 47:25.910
Mother!

47:26.880 --> 47:27.790
Brother.

47:30.020 --> 47:32.480
Wufeng could not find a breakthrough point,

47:32.490 --> 47:34.290
and had no choice but to retreat.

47:35.160 --> 47:36.430
But the Gong family

47:36.780 --> 47:38.510
also paid a huge price for that.

47:39.580 --> 47:40.240
After that,

47:41.470 --> 47:44.000
I've been living in the shadow of self-blame.

47:44.150 --> 47:45.880
You were still young back then.

47:46.280 --> 47:47.740
Why do you blame yourself?

47:48.800 --> 47:49.430
Because

47:51.690 --> 47:54.420
I was the last one to arrive at the secret passage.

47:56.250 --> 47:58.180
The secret tunnel's gate reopened

47:59.360 --> 48:01.440
because I was late.

48:04.570 --> 48:05.440
Lang

48:05.650 --> 48:07.300
took the chance to sneak out

48:08.620 --> 48:09.830
to retrieve

48:11.340 --> 48:13.340
the knife that his brother gave him.

48:19.300 --> 48:20.760
I should be the one who died

48:22.810 --> 48:23.740
instead of him.

48:27.540 --> 48:28.600
If that's the case,

48:31.410 --> 48:32.320
my brother

48:33.160 --> 48:35.490
wouldn't have to suffer so much this life.

48:41.890 --> 48:43.930
This kid has been different from others since they were young.

48:43.930 --> 48:45.250
He likes bugs

48:45.380 --> 48:46.240
and not people.

48:46.890 --> 48:48.700
He didn't even cry when his father died.

48:48.700 --> 48:49.620
He has no heart.

48:50.180 --> 48:51.330
Just like bugs,

48:51.990 --> 48:53.120
he's cold-blooded.

49:26.920 --> 49:28.050
How did you get hurt?

49:32.940 --> 49:35.350
I was scratched by the nail on the coffin.

49:36.830 --> 49:38.050
You'd rather bleed

49:38.440 --> 49:39.470
than cry?

49:43.940 --> 49:45.260
Why should I cry

49:45.500 --> 49:46.370
and shed tears?

49:50.300 --> 49:52.160
Because bleeding can tell others

49:52.850 --> 49:54.310
that your body is injured.

49:55.540 --> 49:56.300
Crying

49:58.170 --> 50:00.370
can tell others that your heart is hurt.

50:01.510 --> 50:03.070
Sometimes one can't tell if

50:03.890 --> 50:04.820
you are sad

50:06.390 --> 50:08.520
and you need tears to tell others that.

50:08.570 --> 50:10.230
Why should I tell others that?

50:10.900 --> 50:12.890
You can get other people to help share the burden

50:12.890 --> 50:14.090
and give you comfort.

50:14.940 --> 50:16.190
But a bleeding wound

50:16.210 --> 50:19.470
doesn't need others to share the pain and give comfort for.

50:21.680 --> 50:23.940
It's probably because the wound can scab

50:25.710 --> 50:27.110
but sadness

50:29.820 --> 50:31.640
can never heal.

50:40.260 --> 50:41.050
After that,

50:41.930 --> 50:44.250
he gave me this knife.

50:45.050 --> 50:46.580
He treated me as his brother

50:47.940 --> 50:50.340
and asked me to learn martial arts with him.

50:56.740 --> 50:57.540
My brother...

51:00.640 --> 51:02.070
went somewhere else.

51:03.240 --> 51:04.560
Don't cry.

51:05.970 --> 51:07.170
I'll be your brother.

51:10.460 --> 51:11.500
Wait for me here.

51:11.690 --> 51:12.820
I'll go find a knife.

51:13.240 --> 51:14.650
I'll be right back.

51:15.060 --> 51:16.050
Don't go.

51:28.040 --> 51:28.840
I won't leave.

51:29.950 --> 51:30.830
You don't leave too.

51:30.830 --> 51:32.640
♫The sunset light falls♫

51:32.880 --> 51:35.610
♫A little ink on my heart♫

51:33.420 --> 51:34.030
This knife

51:34.380 --> 51:35.020
is for you.

51:36.370 --> 51:40.000
♫Two ties of grudges becoming into three lives of mistakes♫

51:37.570 --> 51:38.990
Really?

51:41.970 --> 51:43.880
♫The childhood music♫

51:43.340 --> 51:45.140
I can also practice swordsmanship too!

51:43.910 --> 51:46.570
♫Singing about and old friend's song♫

51:46.090 --> 51:47.580
I can also practice swordsmanship too!

51:47.020 --> 51:51.770
♫What can we do about this guest?♫

51:52.450 --> 51:53.430
Why are you so happy?

51:53.040 --> 51:55.180
♫Whose song♫

51:53.870 --> 51:56.260
Because no one has ever given me a gift.

51:55.830 --> 51:57.930
♫Is matching every line?♫

51:57.460 --> 51:59.450
Do you want me to give you something too then?

51:58.190 --> 52:02.370
♫Fold it gently as the wound spreads♫

52:04.200 --> 52:06.300
♫We share the same hand and feet♫

52:06.670 --> 52:09.130
♫And the same bloodline♫

52:09.590 --> 52:11.510
I've already received the best gift.

52:09.690 --> 52:10.640
♫How do we♫

52:10.940 --> 52:14.060
♫Tell the two of us apart♫

52:15.410 --> 52:19.940
♫Brother♫

52:19.280 --> 52:22.050
Although Brother gave me this knife for Lang

52:20.430 --> 52:24.990
♫You teach me not to cry♫

52:22.070 --> 52:23.150
to me,

52:26.170 --> 52:26.930
I know...

52:26.590 --> 52:27.630
♫Brother♫

52:27.660 --> 52:30.980
♫You see through the world♫

52:27.910 --> 52:31.240
Do you think something new is always better than the old one?

52:31.430 --> 52:33.990
♫But don't understand why♫

52:31.690 --> 52:32.540
In his heart,

52:33.410 --> 52:35.330
no one can replace Lang.

52:34.010 --> 52:36.060
♫I am sad♫

52:50.190 --> 52:51.230
So what?

52:54.580 --> 52:56.200
I'm his brother now.

52:59.420 --> 53:01.440
So I have to do better...

53:03.180 --> 53:04.180
than anyone else.

53:05.430 --> 53:07.490
You've already been doing a good job.

53:11.340 --> 53:11.950
No.

53:14.430 --> 53:15.830
If I did well enough,

53:18.480 --> 53:19.680
Brother should be

53:20.880 --> 53:22.460
smiling all day.

53:29.080 --> 53:30.110
Like you,

53:31.260 --> 53:33.120
I am also doing my best to do things

53:34.380 --> 53:36.800
just to see him smile.

53:39.600 --> 53:40.570
But it seems

53:42.230 --> 53:43.180
I never know

53:43.200 --> 53:44.840
what he really wants.

53:45.860 --> 53:46.570
In his eyes,

53:47.450 --> 53:49.580
there is the martial world's loyalty,

53:49.940 --> 53:51.170
the family's burden

53:51.520 --> 53:53.450
and the Gong family's reputation.

53:55.250 --> 53:56.150
But

53:56.600 --> 53:57.930
there isn't he himself.

54:01.140 --> 54:02.440
I grew up with him.

54:04.720 --> 54:05.480
It seems that

54:05.510 --> 54:07.410
he has never pursued anything.

54:12.650 --> 54:13.700
Until he met you.

54:24.300 --> 54:25.340
I envy you.

54:29.100 --> 54:30.560
And am thankful to you too.

54:32.160 --> 54:33.620
Because you made Brother,

54:34.180 --> 54:35.240
for the first time,

54:36.050 --> 54:38.450
have something he wants to pursue himself.

54:48.780 --> 54:49.420
Really?

54:52.100 --> 54:54.100
When people get close to a tall tree,

54:55.180 --> 54:56.440
they always talk about

54:56.660 --> 54:58.520
how its branches are flourishing

54:58.980 --> 55:00.580
and many fruits are bearing.

55:02.500 --> 55:05.090
People always see its amazing appearance

55:05.250 --> 55:06.460
but no one

55:06.750 --> 55:08.450
pays attention to the huge

55:09.010 --> 55:10.420
yet silent roots.

55:11.560 --> 55:12.370
The roots

55:13.010 --> 55:14.210
are buried in cold...

55:16.340 --> 55:18.090
and dark mud.

55:19.430 --> 55:20.950
Deeply digging into

55:21.840 --> 55:23.080
the hard land

55:23.640 --> 55:25.570
with no complaints and no regrest.

55:27.500 --> 55:28.700
It is also these roots

55:30.820 --> 55:32.410
that no one cares about

55:34.350 --> 55:36.930
that supported all the power to thrive pwards

55:38.690 --> 55:39.530
and wither.

55:41.630 --> 55:42.480
And my brother

55:44.220 --> 55:46.160
is the quiet root.

55:54.540 --> 55:56.000
I raise insects and grass.

55:56.750 --> 55:58.080
I often dig into the soil

55:58.510 --> 55:59.510
to look for herbs.

56:01.500 --> 56:03.430
Every time I dig the root of a tree,

56:05.300 --> 56:07.010
it's as if I saw its heart.

56:10.810 --> 56:12.950
I can feel that he looks strong,

56:14.380 --> 56:15.880
but is soft inside.

56:18.660 --> 56:19.840
From now on,

56:21.780 --> 56:23.070
he can show weakness,

56:25.100 --> 56:26.760
and doesn't have to act tough.

56:29.980 --> 56:30.790
He has me,

56:34.940 --> 56:35.780
and you.

56:45.890 --> 56:47.410
But others don't allow it.

56:52.590 --> 56:54.590
The martial world doesn't allow it.

56:58.170 --> 56:59.940
People who see you as God

57:02.920 --> 57:04.130
will not like you

57:05.660 --> 57:07.930
who are trapped in the dust.

57:24.380 --> 57:25.180
It's so heavy?

57:27.930 --> 57:31.260
So this is the Thousand-Year Xuan Iron  used to forge swords.

57:31.350 --> 57:32.950
It's indeed extraordinary.

57:34.230 --> 57:36.690
You need someone to help you forge the sword.

57:37.300 --> 57:39.090
You can bring your Green Jade Guardian

57:39.090 --> 57:40.290
to the forgery place.

57:42.900 --> 57:44.360
My Green Jade Guardian...

57:45.100 --> 57:45.670
Jin Fan.

57:47.810 --> 57:48.970
But he swore

57:49.300 --> 57:51.560
he would never enter the back hill again.

57:52.280 --> 57:53.540
I've already applied.

57:53.820 --> 57:55.350
For the trial of this realm,

57:55.370 --> 57:57.300
he can enter the back hill with you.

57:57.310 --> 57:59.560
The Council of Elders has sent someone to inform him.

57:59.560 --> 58:01.820
He should be on his way to the Hua Lineage.

58:02.820 --> 58:05.020
This is also on the sake of Gong Zishang?

58:05.740 --> 58:07.670
You're taking such good care of me.

58:08.050 --> 58:09.500
I should say thank you.

58:12.290 --> 58:13.880
I hope you can still say this

58:14.740 --> 58:16.400
after you finish the forgery.

58:20.540 --> 58:21.970
I heard

58:22.930 --> 58:26.090
Gong Ziyu has passed the second realm.

58:27.420 --> 58:28.020
Father,

58:28.050 --> 58:28.570
yes.

58:29.630 --> 58:30.070
Humph.

58:33.030 --> 58:34.450
He can't

58:36.220 --> 58:37.700
pass the third trial.

58:38.580 --> 58:41.420
Gong Ziyu has passed the first two trials smoothly.

58:41.420 --> 58:44.080
The third trial is different from the first two.

58:49.270 --> 58:50.340
Back then,

58:51.940 --> 58:53.420
I lost to my weakness

58:53.420 --> 58:55.400
on this trial.

58:58.850 --> 59:02.010
To use my personal guard as a sacrifice

59:03.500 --> 59:04.900
is not something I can do.

59:05.250 --> 59:07.580
Using your personal guard as a sacrifice?

59:08.440 --> 59:09.020
Father.

59:09.830 --> 59:10.900
What do you mean?

59:14.400 --> 59:17.990
Since ancient times, it's said that great weapons come from the souls of talents.

59:17.990 --> 59:19.680
The ancestors think

59:20.360 --> 59:21.230
this soul

59:22.240 --> 59:24.640
comes from the sacrifice of a living person

59:24.980 --> 59:27.640
for their faith and believes to be adhered to it.

59:28.920 --> 59:31.470
The soul of a personal guard

59:33.120 --> 59:36.850
can represent killing the enemy and protecting the master.

59:45.710 --> 59:46.570
Sword Wielder,

59:46.670 --> 59:47.380
I'm late.

59:47.620 --> 59:50.100
I've prepared the food and water we need for these few days.

59:50.100 --> 59:51.700
See if we need anything else.

59:53.050 --> 59:53.620
No need.

59:54.460 --> 59:55.000
Sirs,

59:55.860 --> 59:57.660
the third realm's trial begins.

59:58.420 --> 59:59.230
Good luck.

01:00:13.530 --> 01:00:14.170
Gong Ziyu.

01:00:15.360 --> 01:00:16.560
I hope you can succeed

01:00:19.770 --> 01:00:21.230
but also hope you can fail.

01:00:26.620 --> 01:00:27.480
Gold leaf kite?

01:00:28.900 --> 01:00:30.110
My god.

01:00:30.540 --> 01:00:33.070
The family rules are going to be broken again.

01:00:58.900 --> 01:00:59.660
Lie down.

01:00:59.660 --> 01:01:00.320
Don't move.

01:01:12.190 --> 01:01:13.110
I didn't expect

01:01:15.620 --> 01:01:17.280
you'd take the same path as me.

01:01:20.920 --> 01:01:22.650
Since you've made your choice,

01:01:23.680 --> 01:01:25.030
just stick to it.

01:01:29.260 --> 01:01:30.190
Do you regret it?

01:01:33.970 --> 01:01:34.880
Never.

01:01:43.650 --> 01:01:45.780
Do you know about the Fortnight Flies?

01:01:50.280 --> 01:01:51.610
You are very lucky then.

01:01:53.480 --> 01:01:54.880
Wufeng hasn't started to

01:01:56.020 --> 01:01:56.980
control you with the Fortnight Flies

01:01:56.980 --> 01:01:58.600
during your generation.

01:01:59.640 --> 01:02:03.170
You have never experienced the pain of the Fortnight Flies too.

01:02:03.570 --> 01:02:06.370
But if you were physically and mentally tortured,

01:02:07.420 --> 01:02:09.100
and that you knew that once you betray someone,

01:02:09.100 --> 01:02:10.660
you will definitely die,

01:02:12.450 --> 01:02:14.050
would you have still chosen

01:02:14.070 --> 01:02:15.470
to enter the Gong family?

01:02:24.610 --> 01:02:25.940
Are you afraid of death?

01:02:29.110 --> 01:02:30.410
Everyone dies.

01:02:33.650 --> 01:02:34.530
A worthy death

01:02:37.550 --> 01:02:39.350
will make their hearts at peace.

01:02:41.460 --> 01:02:42.650
What we fear is

01:02:44.410 --> 01:02:45.650
dying for no reason.

01:02:48.520 --> 01:02:49.910
I won't change my choice

01:02:51.960 --> 01:02:53.510
even if I get to do it again.

01:02:56.070 --> 01:02:58.070
I don't think you would have either.

01:03:01.570 --> 01:03:03.230
Ziyu is a trustworthy person.

01:03:04.370 --> 01:03:05.760
I watched him grow up.

01:03:07.980 --> 01:03:10.110
I've treated him as my own son.

01:03:14.420 --> 01:03:16.340
So I hope you won't let him down...

01:03:18.010 --> 01:03:19.020
and hurt him.

01:03:29.420 --> 01:03:30.280
What about you?

01:03:32.030 --> 01:03:33.420
When are you going to tell him

01:03:33.420 --> 01:03:34.480
you're Anonymous?

01:03:37.260 --> 01:03:38.590
You are also hurting him

01:03:40.590 --> 01:03:42.320
by hiding it from him like this.

01:03:47.120 --> 01:03:49.130
I'll tell him everything

01:03:52.660 --> 01:03:55.190
after he passes the Trial of the Three Realms.

01:03:59.820 --> 01:04:01.080
The box outside

01:04:01.190 --> 01:04:03.040
was a gift from the former Sword Wielder

01:04:03.040 --> 01:04:04.520
for his daughter-in-law.

01:04:07.060 --> 01:04:08.320
I'll give it to you now.

01:04:12.220 --> 01:04:13.550
Think about what I said.

01:04:16.320 --> 01:04:18.070
Don't let the people who love you down.
